TI  - Optimization of cellulose extraction process from sugar beet pulp and preparation of its nanofibers with choline chloride–lactic acid deep eutectic solvents
T2  - Biomass Conversion and Biorefinery
PY  - 2023
SP  - 14457
EP  - 14469
