TI  - Optimisation of an enzymatic method to obtain modified artichoke pectin and pectic oligosaccharides using artificial neural network tools. In silico and in vitro assessment of the antioxidant activity
T2  - Food Hydrocolloids
PY  - 2021
DO  - 10.1016/j.foodhyd.2020.106161
