TI  - Correction: Reductive catalytic fractionation of agricultural residue and energy crop lignin and application of lignin oil in antimicrobials (Green Chemistry (2020) 22 (7435–7447) DOI: 10.1039/D0GC02781B)
T2  - Green Chemistry
PY  - 2025
